{# Siteler (çok site). Mantık: panel/sites.js; kodmob-api Core\Sites. Yalnızca ana sitede (km_manage_sites). #}
<div class="pn-page" x-data="kmSites" data-testid="sites">
  <div class="pn-toolbar">
    <p class="pn-hint flex-1">
      <svg class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-info"/></svg>
      <span>Aynı kurulumdan alt siteler. Her birinin veritabanı, kullanıcıları, ayarları ve görselleri ayrı; kod ve yeni sürümler ortak. Alan adını sunucuda ana siteyle aynı klasöre yönlendirin.</span>
    </p>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" x-show="pending.length" x-cloak @click="migrate()" :disabled="!!busy" data-testid="sites-migrate-all">
      <svg class="icon icon-sm" :class="busy === 'all' && 'animate-spin'" aria-hidden="true"><use :href="busy === 'all' ? '#i-loader' : '#i-refresh'"/></svg>
      Tümünü güncelle
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" @click="openCreate()" data-testid="site-new">
      <svg class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg> Yeni site
    </button>
  </div>

  <template x-if="loading">
    <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2"><span class="skeleton h-48"></span><span class="skeleton h-48"></span></div>
  </template>

  <template x-if="!loading && !sites.length">
    <div class="card pn-empty">
      <span class="icon-tile icon-tile-round"><svg class="icon icon-lg" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-layers"/></svg></span>
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Henüz alt site yok</p>
      <p class="max-w-md text-sm text-ink-2">Bir müşteri ya da marka için yeni site kurun: kendi alan adı (ya da alt alan adı), kendi paneli ve kullanıcılarıyla. Kurulum birkaç saniye sürer; sunucuda ayrı yükleme gerekmez.</p>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" @click="openCreate()"><svg class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-plus"/></svg> İlk siteyi kur</button>
    </div>
  </template>

  <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2" x-show="!loading && sites.length" x-cloak>
    <template x-for="site in sites" :key="site.key">
      <article class="card flex flex-col gap-4 p-5" :data-site="site.key">
        <header class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="icon-tile"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></span>
          <div class="min-w-0 flex-1">
            <p class="truncate text-lg font-bold text-ink" x-text="site.name"></p>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted"><span class="code" x-text="site.key"></span><span x-show="site.created_at" x-text="' · ' + fmt.date(site.created_at)"></span></p>
          </div>
          <span class="badge shrink-0" :class="'badge-' + status(site).tone" :title="status(site).title" x-text="status(site).label" data-testid="site-status"></span>
        </header>

        <dl class="grid gap-2 text-sm sm:grid-cols-[8rem_1fr]">
          <dt class="text-muted">Alan adları</dt>
          <dd class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
            <template x-for="d in site.domains" :key="d">
              <a :href="'https://' + d" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary hover:underline" x-text="d"></a>
            </template>
          </dd>
          <dt class="text-muted">Veritabanı</dt>
          <dd x-text="dbLabel(site)"></dd>
          <dt class="text-muted">Modüller</dt>
          <dd x-text="moduleLabels(site)"></dd>
        </dl>
        <p class="rounded-control bg-danger-soft p-3 text-sm text-danger-ink" x-show="site.status?.error" x-text="site.status?.error"></p>

        <footer class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap gap-2">
          <a :href="siteUrl(site) + '/panel/'" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm"><svg class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-external"/></svg> Panele git</a>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" @click="openEdit(site)"><svg class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-pencil"/></svg> Düzenle</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" x-show="site.status?.pending || site.status?.error" @click="migrate(site)" :disabled="!!busy">
            <svg class="icon icon-sm" :class="busy === site.key && 'animate-spin'" aria-hidden="true"><use :href="busy === site.key ? '#i-loader' : '#i-refresh'"/></svg> Tabloları güncelle
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm ml-auto text-danger" @click="remove(site)" :disabled="!!busy"><svg class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-trash"/></svg> Kayıttan çıkar</button>
        </footer>
      </article>
    </template>
  </div>

  {# ============================================================ yeni site / düzenle #}
  <template x-if="dialog && form">
    <div>
      <div class="pn-modal-backdrop" @click="close()"></div>
      <div class="pn-modal-wrap">
        <form class="pn-modal max-w-2xl" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="site-title" @submit.prevent="created ? close() : save()" @keydown.escape.window="close()" novalidate data-testid="site-dialog">
          <header class="pn-modal-head">
            <svg class="icon text-muted" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-layers"/></svg>
            <h2 id="site-title" class="h3" x-text="dialog.mode === 'create' ? (created ? 'Site kuruldu' : 'Yeni site') : 'Siteyi düzenle'"></h2>
            <button type="button" class="btn-icon ml-auto" @click="close()" aria-label="Kapat"><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></button>
          </header>

          {# Kurulum bitti: sonraki adımlar #}
          <template x-if="created">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 text-sm" data-testid="site-created">
              <p><strong x-text="created.name"></strong> kuruldu; tabloları ve ilk yöneticisi hazır.</p>
              <ol class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-ink-2">
                <li>Alan adını sunucuda ana siteyle <strong>aynı klasöre</strong> yönlendirin. Hostinger: alt alan adı için klasör olarak <span class="code">public_html</span> seçin; başka bir alan adını nameserver'larını Hostinger'a çevirip ana siteye "takma alan adı" (alias) olarak ekleyin. SSL'i Hostinger verir.</li>
                <li>Sonra <a :href="siteUrl(created) + '/panel/'" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-primary hover:underline" x-text="siteUrl(created) + '/panel/'"></a> adresinden ilk yöneticiyle girin.</li>
                <li>Site şimdilik ana sitenin temasını kullanır; içerik, ayarlar ve kullanıcılar kendisinindir.</li>
              </ol>
            </div>
          </template>

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-5 overflow-y-auto p-5" x-show="!created">
            {# Site Sihirbazı ya da boş site (yalnızca yeni sitede) #}
            <template x-if="dialog.mode === 'create' && wizard">
              <div class="pn-tabs w-max" role="tablist" aria-label="Kurulum biçimi">
                <button type="button" role="tab" class="pn-tab" :aria-selected="wizard.on" @click="wizard.on = true" data-testid="wizard-on"><svg class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-sparkles"/></svg> Sihirbazla kur</button>
                <button type="button" role="tab" class="pn-tab" :aria-selected="!wizard.on" @click="wizard.on = false"><svg class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-layers"/></svg> Boş site</button>
              </div>
            </template>
            <section class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field-label">Site adı <span class="req">*</span></span>
                <input class="input" x-model="form.name" @input="nameChanged()" maxlength="100" data-site-first :aria-invalid="!!errors.name" data-testid="site-name">
                <span class="field-error" x-show="errors.name" x-text="errors.name"></span>
              </label>
              <label class="field">
                <span class="field-label">Anahtar <span class="req" x-show="dialog.mode === 'create'">*</span></span>
                <input class="input font-mono" x-model="form.key" @input="keyTouched = true" maxlength="32" :disabled="dialog.mode === 'edit'" :aria-invalid="!!errors.key" data-testid="site-key">
                <span class="field-help">Klasör ve kayıt adı; sonradan değişmez. Küçük harf, rakam, tire.</span>
                <span class="field-error" x-show="errors.key" x-text="errors.key"></span>
              </label>
              <label class="field sm:col-span-2">
                <span class="field-label">Alan adları <span class="req" x-show="!(dialog.mode === 'create' && isLocal && form.local)">*</span></span>
                <textarea class="input min-h-20 font-mono" rows="2" x-model="form.domains" placeholder="musteri.kodmob.com&#10;musteri.com" :aria-invalid="!!errors.domains" data-testid="site-domains"></textarea>
                <span class="field-help">Her satıra bir alan adı (https:// olmadan). "www." ayrıca yazılmaz.</span>
                <span class="field-error" x-show="errors.domains" x-text="errors.domains"></span>
              </label>
              {# Yerel geliştirme: panel bu bilgisayardaysa yeni siteye anahtar.localhost (hosts dosyası gerekmez). #}
              <template x-if="dialog.mode === 'create' && isLocal">
                <label class="flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-3 rounded-control border border-line p-3 sm:col-span-2" data-testid="site-local">
                  <input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-primary" x-model="form.local">
                  <span>
                    <span class="block font-medium text-ink">Yerel deneme adresi ekle</span>
                    <span class="block text-xs text-muted" x-text="localPreview ? 'Bu bilgisayarda ' + localPreview + ' adresinden açılır (Chrome, Edge, Firefox ek ayar istemez). Canlıda gerçek alan adını ekleyin.' : 'Anahtar yazılınca anahtar.localhost eklenir.'"></span>
                  </span>
                </label>
              </template>
              <label class="field sm:col-span-2">
                <span class="field-label">Adres</span>
                <input class="input" x-model="form.url" placeholder="Boşsa https:// + ilk alan adı" :aria-invalid="!!errors.url">
                <span class="field-help">Kanonik adresler, site haritası ve e-postalardaki bağlantılar bu adresle.</span>
                <span class="field-error" x-show="errors.url" x-text="errors.url"></span>
              </label>
            </section>

            {# ------------------------------------------------ Site Sihirbazı (kodmob-api Core\Sites\SiteWizard) #}
            <template x-if="dialog.mode === 'create' && wizard?.on">
              <section class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-card border border-line bg-surface-subtle p-4" data-testid="wizard">
                <div>
                  <p class="font-semibold text-ink">İşletme bilgisi</p>
                  <p class="text-sm text-ink-2" x-text="aiReady ? 'Yapay zekâ bu bilgilerle logo yazısını, renkleri, site açıklamasını, sayfa metinlerini ve taslak hizmetleri önerir. Kurmadan önce görüp düzenlersiniz.' : 'Yapay zekâ anahtarı yok (Ayarlar > Yapay zekâ): sihirbaz yalnızca logo yazısı ve renkleri önerir; metinler şablondaki gibi kalır.'"></p>
                </div>
                <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field-label">Sektör <span class="req">*</span></span>
                    <input class="input" x-model="wizard.sector" list="wizard-sectors" placeholder="ör. diş kliniği" maxlength="80" :aria-invalid="!!errors.sector" data-testid="wizard-sector">
                    <datalist id="wizard-sectors"><option>Diş kliniği</option><option>Estetik ve sağlık turizmi</option><option>Restoran</option><option>Otel</option><option>Emlak ofisi</option><option>Hukuk bürosu</option><option>Mimarlık ofisi</option><option>Eğitim ve kurs</option><option>Üretim ve ihracat</option><option>Yazılım ve ajans</option></datalist>
                    <span class="field-error" x-show="errors.sector" x-text="errors.sector"></span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field-label">Şehir</span>
                    <input class="input" x-model="wizard.city" placeholder="ör. Adana" maxlength="80">
                  </label>
                  <label class="field sm:col-span-2">
                    <span class="field-label">Kısa tanım <span class="req">*</span></span>
                    <textarea class="input min-h-24" rows="3" x-model="wizard.about" maxlength="1200" placeholder="Ne yapıyorsunuz, kime, sizi ayıran ne? Birkaç cümle." :aria-invalid="!!errors.about" data-testid="wizard-about"></textarea>
                    <span class="field-error" x-show="errors.about" x-text="errors.about"></span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field sm:col-span-2">
                    <span class="field-label">Gerçek bilgiler</span>
                    <textarea class="input min-h-16" rows="2" x-model="wizard.facts" maxlength="800" placeholder="ör. 2012'den beri, 3 şube, 14 kişilik ekip, Almanca ve İngilizce hizmet"></textarea>
                    <span class="field-help">Sayfalardaki rakamlar yalnızca buradan alınır; yapay zekâ rakam, yıl ya da müşteri adı uydurmaz.</span>
                  </label>
                  <label class="field">
                    <span class="field-label">Dil tonu</span>
                    <select class="input" x-model="wizard.tone">
                      <template x-for="(label, key) in tones" :key="key"><option :value="key" x-text="label" :selected="wizard.tone === key"></option></template>
                    </select>
                  </label>
                  <div class="field">
                    <span class="field-label">Ana renk</span>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                      <input type="color" class="h-11 w-14 shrink-0 cursor-pointer rounded-control border border-line bg-surface p-1" :value="wizard.color || '#1f5eff'" @input="wizard.color = $event.target.value" aria-label="Ana renk seç">
                      <span class="text-sm text-ink-2" x-text="wizard.color ? wizard.color : 'Boşsa sihirbaz önerir'"></span>
                      <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" x-show="wizard.color" @click="wizard.color = ''">Sıfırla</button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="field sm:col-span-2" x-show="languages.length > 1">
                    <span class="field-label">Diller</span>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                      <template x-for="l in languages" :key="l.code">
                        <label class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-control border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-2 text-sm">
                          <input type="checkbox" class="h-4 w-4 accent-primary" :checked="l.default || wizard.languages.includes(l.code)" :disabled="l.default" @change="toggleLanguage(l.code)">
                          <span x-text="l.label + (l.default ? ' (varsayılan)' : '')"></span>
                        </label>
                      </template>
                    </div>
                    <span class="field-help">Seçilmeyen diller yeni sitede kapatılır. Her ek dil metinlerin çevirisi için bir yapay zekâ çağrısı daha demektir.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
                  <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" @click="makePlan()" :disabled="planning" data-testid="wizard-plan">
                    <svg class="icon icon-sm" :class="planning && 'animate-spin'" aria-hidden="true"><use :href="planning ? '#i-loader' : '#i-sparkles'"/></svg>
                    <span x-text="planning ? 'Öneri hazırlanıyor… (bir dakikayı bulabilir)' : (plan ? 'Yeniden öner' : 'Öneri oluştur')"></span>
                  </button>
                  <span class="text-xs text-muted" x-show="!plan && !planning">Öneri olmadan da kurabilirsiniz; site şablondaki gibi açılır.</span>
                </div>

                {# Öneri: önizle ve düzenle #}
                <template x-if="plan">
                  <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-card border border-line bg-surface p-4" data-plan data-testid="wizard-plan-result">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
                      <span class="flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight" :style="{ color: plan.identity.color }"><span x-text="plan.identity.logo"></span><span class="text-sm font-semibold" x-text="plan.identity.logo_sub"></span></span>
                      <span class="flex gap-1.5">
                        <span class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full border border-line" :style="{ background: plan.identity.color }" :title="'Ana renk ' + plan.identity.color"></span>
                        <span class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full border border-line" :style="{ background: plan.identity.color_dark }" :title="'Koyu bant ' + plan.identity.color_dark"></span>
                      </span>
                      <span class="badge" :class="plan.ai ? 'badge-primary' : 'badge-neutral'" x-text="plan.ai ? 'Yapay zekâ önerisi · ' + plan.provider : 'Yapay zekâsız (yalnızca kimlik)'"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                      <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Logo yazısı</span><input class="input" x-model="plan.identity.logo" maxlength="24"></label>
                      <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Logo alt yazısı</span><input class="input" x-model="plan.identity.logo_sub" maxlength="24"></label>
                      <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Ana renk</span><input type="color" class="h-11 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-control border border-line bg-surface p-1" x-model="plan.identity.color"></label>
                      <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Koyu bant rengi</span><input type="color" class="h-11 w-full cursor-pointer rounded-control border border-line bg-surface p-1" x-model="plan.identity.color_dark"></label>
                      <label class="field sm:col-span-2"><span class="field-label">Site açıklaması (arama sonuçları)</span><textarea class="input" rows="2" x-model="plan.description" maxlength="160"></textarea></label>
                    </div>
                    <template x-if="plan.ai">
                      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                        <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Ana sayfa başlığı</span><input class="input" :value="planText('home.hero.title')" @input="setPlanText('home.hero.title', $event.target.value)" data-testid="wizard-hero"></label>
                        <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Ana sayfa giriş metni</span><textarea class="input" rows="3" :value="planText('home.hero.lead')" @input="setPlanText('home.hero.lead', $event.target.value)"></textarea></label>
                        <div class="field">
                          <span class="field-label" x-text="'Hizmetler (taslak olarak eklenir: ' + plan.services.length + ')'"></span>
                          <template x-for="(s, i) in plan.services" :key="i">
                            <div class="flex items-start gap-2 rounded-control border border-line p-2">
                              <div class="grid min-w-0 flex-1 gap-1">
                                <input class="input" x-model="s.title" maxlength="80" :aria-label="'Hizmet ' + (i + 1)">
                                <textarea class="input text-sm" rows="2" x-model="s.text" maxlength="300" :aria-label="'Hizmet ' + (i + 1) + ' açıklaması'"></textarea>
                              </div>
                              <button type="button" class="btn-icon" @click="removeService(i)" aria-label="Hizmeti çıkar"><svg class="icon icon-sm" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></button>
                            </div>
                          </template>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-xs text-muted" x-text="'Sayfa metinleri: ' + plan.counts.texts + ' metin, ' + plan.languages.length + ' dilde uyarlandı. Kurduktan sonra yeni sitenin panelinde Çoklu Dil > Metinler\'den düzenlenir.'"></p>
                      </div>
                    </template>
                    <template x-for="w in plan.warnings" :key="w"><p class="rounded-control bg-warning-soft p-3 text-sm text-warning-ink" x-text="w"></p></template>
                  </div>
                </template>
              </section>
            </template>

            <section class="flex flex-col gap-2">
              <p class="field-label">Modüller</p>
              <div class="grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
                <template x-for="m in modules" :key="m.key">
                  <label class="flex items-start gap-3 rounded-control border border-line p-3">
                    <input type="checkbox" class="mt-0.5 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 accent-primary" :checked="form.modules.includes(m.key)" @change="toggleModule(m.key)" :data-module="m.key">
                    <span><span class="block font-medium text-ink" x-text="m.label"></span><span class="block text-xs text-muted" x-text="m.description"></span></span>
                  </label>
                </template>
              </div>
              <span class="field-help">Çekirdek (kullanıcılar, içerik türleri, SEO, çoklu dil, güvenlik, yedek…) her zaman açık.</span>
              <span class="field-error" x-show="errors.modules" x-text="errors.modules"></span>
            </section>

            <template x-if="dialog.mode === 'create'">
              <section class="flex flex-col gap-4">
                <label class="field">
                  <span class="field-label">Veritabanı</span>
                  <select class="input" x-model="form.db.driver" data-testid="site-driver">
                    <template x-for="d in drivers" :key="d.key"><option :value="d.key" x-text="d.label" :selected="form.db.driver === d.key"></option></template>
                  </select>
                  <span class="field-help" x-text="driver.help"></span>
                  <span class="field-error" x-show="errors['db.driver'] || errors['db.database']" x-text="errors['db.driver'] || errors['db.database']"></span>
                </label>
                <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" x-show="form.db.driver !== 'sqlite'" x-cloak>
                  <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Sunucu <span class="req">*</span></span><input class="input" x-model="form.db.host" placeholder="localhost" :aria-invalid="!!errors['db.host']"><span class="field-error" x-show="errors['db.host']" x-text="errors['db.host']"></span></label>
                  <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Port</span><input class="input" x-model="form.db.port" inputmode="numeric" :placeholder="form.db.driver === 'pgsql' ? '5432' : '3306'" :aria-invalid="!!errors['db.port']"><span class="field-error" x-show="errors['db.port']" x-text="errors['db.port']"></span></label>
                  <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Veritabanı adı <span class="req">*</span></span><input class="input" x-model="form.db.database" autocomplete="off" :aria-invalid="!!errors['db.database']"></label>
                  <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Kullanıcı adı <span class="req">*</span></span><input class="input" x-model="form.db.username" autocomplete="off" :aria-invalid="!!errors['db.username']"><span class="field-error" x-show="errors['db.username']" x-text="errors['db.username']"></span></label>
                  <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Şifre</span><input class="input" type="password" x-model="form.db.password" autocomplete="new-password"><span class="field-help">Şifreli saklanır, bir daha gösterilmez.</span></label>
                  <label class="field" x-show="form.db.driver === 'pgsql'"><span class="field-label">Şema</span><input class="input font-mono" x-model="form.db.schema" :placeholder="form.key ? 'site_' + form.key.replaceAll('-', '_') : 'site_demo'" :aria-invalid="!!errors['db.schema']"><span class="field-help">Boşsa public. Bütün siteler tek veritabanında ayrı şemalarda durabilir.</span><span class="field-error" x-show="errors['db.schema']" x-text="errors['db.schema']"></span></label>
                </div>
              </section>
            </template>

            <template x-if="dialog.mode === 'create'">
              <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <p class="field-label">İlk yönetici</p>
                <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                  <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Kullanıcı adı <span class="req">*</span></span><input class="input" x-model="form.admin.username" autocomplete="off" :aria-invalid="!!errors['admin.username']" data-testid="site-admin-username"><span class="field-error" x-show="errors['admin.username']" x-text="errors['admin.username']"></span></label>
                  <label class="field"><span class="field-label">E-posta <span class="req">*</span></span><input class="input" type="email" x-model="form.admin.email" autocomplete="off" :aria-invalid="!!errors['admin.email']" data-testid="site-admin-email"><span class="field-error" x-show="errors['admin.email']" x-text="errors['admin.email']"></span></label>
                  <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Ad soyad</span><input class="input" x-model="form.admin.display_name" autocomplete="off"></label>
                  <label class="field"><span class="field-label">Şifre <span class="req">*</span></span><input class="input" type="password" x-model="form.admin.password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="10" :aria-invalid="!!errors['admin.password']" data-testid="site-admin-password"><span class="field-error" x-show="errors['admin.password']" x-text="errors['admin.password']"></span></label>
                </div>
                <span class="field-help">Bu hesap yalnızca yeni sitenin panelinde geçerlidir; ana sitenin kullanıcıları orada yoktur.</span>
              </section>
            </template>
          </div>

          <footer class="pn-modal-foot">
            <template x-if="!created">
              <div class="contents">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" @click="close()" :disabled="saving">Vazgeç</button>
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" :disabled="saving" data-testid="site-save">
                  <svg class="icon icon-sm animate-spin" aria-hidden="true" x-show="saving" x-cloak><use href="#i-loader"/></svg>
                  <span x-text="saving ? (dialog.mode === 'create' ? 'Kuruluyor…' : 'Kaydediliyor…') : (dialog.mode === 'create' ? 'Siteyi kur' : 'Kaydet')"></span>
                </button>
              </div>
            </template>
            <template x-if="created">
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Tamam</button>
            </template>
          </footer>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </template>
</div>
